sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant SCH as Scheduler (every 15 min)
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant NTF as Notification service
  participant MAIL as Email provider
  participant PUSH as Browser push services

  loop Every 15 minutes (missed runs execute within 1 h after restart)
    SCH->>DB: Unsubmitted slots due in<br/>23–24 h, no reminder sent
    SCH->>NTF: Reminder to student<br/>(key: slot + "reminder")
    SCH->>DB: Slots past due_at, no<br/>submission, no Missing flag
    SCH->>DB: Set Missing flag (once)
    SCH->>NTF: Notify student and<br/>academic supervisor
    SCH->>DB: Items overdue ≥ 3 days<br/>(reports, attendance,<br/>evaluations), not escalated
    SCH->>NTF: Escalate to coordinator
  end
  NTF->>DB: In-app notification<br/>(skip if key already sent)
  NTF->>MAIL: Email in the<br/>recipient's language
  NTF->>PUSH: Web push: event title<br/>only, no personal data
  Note over SCH,PUSH: Idempotency keys stop duplicate reminders and escalations (NFR-REL-03)
